{
  "scenario_brief": "TEST: interactionWarning attribute\n\nMinimal 1-room scenario proving the interactionWarning any object can carry. A warning is shown BEFORE the object's normal interaction.\n  - DECLINE runs onDecline and STOPS (the normal interaction is blocked).\n  - PROCEED runs onProceed, THEN the object's normal interaction runs (the readable note opens).\n\nTwo objects:\n  - EVIDENCE BOX (once: true): Proceed sets iw_box_proceeded and adds a capture; Decline sets iw_box_declined and completes a task. After either choice the warning is answered-and-done (does not show again). Answered state persists over reload.\n  - LOGGED TERMINAL (once: false): a Decline is NOT recorded, so the warning shows AGAIN next time you interact. A Proceed is always permanent.",
  "endGoal": "Exercise the evidence box and the logged terminal to prove the interactionWarning flow. There is no win condition; this is an engine test.",
  "startRoom": "test_room",

  "objectives": [
    {
      "aimId": "exercise_warning",
      "title": "Exercise the interaction warning",
      "description": "Interact with the evidence box and the logged terminal.",
      "status": "active",
      "order": 0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "taskId": "box_declined_task",
          "title": "Decline opening the evidence box",
          "type": "custom",
          "status": "active"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "rooms": {
    "test_room": {
      "type": "room_office",
      "door_sign": "Test Room",
      "connections": {},
      "objects": [
        {
          "type": "notes",
          "name": "Instructions",
          "position": { "x": 2, "y": 2 },
          "takeable": false,
          "readable": true,
          "readDisplay": "gameDisplay",
          "addToNotes": false,
          "text": "TEST: interactionWarning\n\nEVIDENCE BOX (once: true): interacting shows a warning first.\n  - Leave it: sets iw_box_declined, completes box_declined_task, BLOCKS the note.\n  - Open it anyway: sets iw_box_proceeded, adds a capture, THEN opens the box note.\n  After either choice the warning will not show again (answered-and-done), and that persists over reload.\n\nLOGGED TERMINAL (once: false): interacting shows a warning first.\n  - Back off: sets iw_term_declined; the warning SHOWS AGAIN next time you interact.\n  - Continue: sets iw_term_proceeded, then opens the terminal note (permanent).",
          "observations": "A note with test instructions."
        },
        {
          "type": "notes",
          "id": "evidence_box",
          "name": "Sealed evidence box",
          "position": { "x": 6, "y": 2 },
          "takeable": false,
          "readable": true,
          "readDisplay": "gameDisplay",
          "addToNotes": false,
          "text": "EVIDENCE BOX CONTENTS (simulated): a bundle of client deeds. You opened it after the warning — the normal interaction ran.",
          "observations": "A sealed evidence box. Interacting warns you before it opens.",
          "interactionWarning": {
            "text": "This box holds sealed client evidence. Opening it may breach the rules of engagement.",
            "proceedLabel": "Open it anyway",
            "declineLabel": "Leave it",
            "once": true,
            "onProceed": [
              { "type": "set_global", "key": "iw_box_proceeded", "value": true },
              { "type": "add_capture", "capture": { "targetId": "evidence_box", "kind": "foothold", "note": "Opened the sealed evidence box after the warning", "at": 0 } }
            ],
            "onDecline": [
              { "type": "set_global", "key": "iw_box_declined", "value": true },
              { "type": "complete_task", "taskId": "box_declined_task" }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "notes",
          "id": "logged_terminal",
          "name": "Logged terminal",
          "position": { "x": 9, "y": 2 },
          "takeable": false,
          "readable": true,
          "readDisplay": "gameDisplay",
          "addToNotes": false,
          "text": "TERMINAL (simulated): access logged. You continued past the warning — the normal interaction ran.",
          "observations": "A terminal that logs every access. Interacting warns you before it opens.",
          "interactionWarning": {
            "text": "This terminal logs every access. Continue?",
            "proceedLabel": "Continue",
            "declineLabel": "Back off",
            "once": false,
            "onProceed": [
              { "type": "set_global", "key": "iw_term_proceeded", "value": true }
            ],
            "onDecline": [
              { "type": "set_global", "key": "iw_term_declined", "value": true }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },

  "globalVariables": {
    "iw_box_proceeded": false,
    "iw_box_declined": false,
    "iw_term_proceeded": false,
    "iw_term_declined": false
  }
}
